			"Message": "style(Worker): Merge emoji badges into component names with Unicode space in README\n\nThe README table previously rendered emoji badges (donut for Worker, mountain for Land) on separate lines from their component names. Combine each emoji directly with its label using an EM QUAD space (U+2001) — 🍩 with Worker and 🏞️ with Land — removing the line breaks.\n\nThis simplifies the table markup while preserving visual separation between the component name and its badge.",
