			"Message": "style(Worker): Consolidate emoji badges into component names in README table\n\nThe README table previously rendered emoji badges (donut for Worker, mountain for Land) in separate table cells, creating unnecessary visual separation. Merge each emoji directly into its component name cell — 🍩 with Worker and 🏞️ with Land — and remove the now-empty emoji-only columns.\n\nThis simplifies the table markup, reduces column count, and keeps the badge visually attached to its label without changing the rendered appearance.",
